# Component reuse (required for AI agents)

Before creating a new component, **search and reuse** what already exists. Only create something new when nothing similar covers the need (after checking `src/components/common/`, domain folders, and `src/forms/`).

Full catalog: [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) → **UI component reuse**.

## Prefer these

| Need | Use |
|------|-----|
| Buttons / CTAs | `PillButton` + `tone` — do not invent a parallel button |
| Logo | `Logo` (`sm` \| `md` \| `lg` \| `xl`, `variant`) |
| Section title + subtitle | `SectionHeader` |
| Phone input | `PhoneField` |
| Profile multiline text | `StyledTextArea` — keep `RichTextEditor` for posts only |
| Password strength UI | `PasswordStrengthIndicator` + `validateStrongPassword` |
| App chrome / navbar | `PageNavbar`, `SiteHeader` |
| Theme switch | `ThemeToggle` |

## Rules

1. Extend an existing component (new `tone`, prop, size) before adding a sibling file.
2. Do not wrap MUI `Button` for branded actions when `PillButton` fits.
3. Colors from `src/theme/theme.ts` only — no hardcoded brand hex in new UI.
4. Domain UI goes under `src/components/<domain>/`; shared atoms under `src/components/common/`.
5. Forms live in `src/forms/` — reuse shared register steps when possible.
6. Every `PillButton` / MUI button uses `BUTTON_BORDER_RADIUS` (`10px`) — rounded rectangle like **Voltar**. Never `9999`, stadium, or a more rounded primary than the outline secondary. Do not override `borderRadius` at the call site.
7. Every component must be built **mobile-first**. Default styles target `xs` (~360px); button groups stack vertically on mobile screens.
